003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e- Làm sạch bụi bẩn và bã nhờn trong lỗ chân lông\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e- Làm dịu da, hỗ trợ ngăn ngừa mụn cho da\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e- Cân bằng độ ẩm tự nhiên cho da\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e- Se khít lỗ chân lông, giúp da luôn mịn màng\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e- Dưỡng da trắng sáng, rạng ngời, tươi trẻ\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/fb/80/c8/9a360e631e247e704120316e2388374b.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"535\" /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHƯỚNG DẪN SỬ SỤNG\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e– Sau khi làm sạch mặt, lấy một lượng vừa đủ ra bông tẩy trang và lau đều khắp mặt. Dùng tay vỗ nhẹ để tinh chất thấm sâu vào da.\u003cbr /\u003e– Sử dụng mỗi ngày 2 lần sáng và tối giúp da sạch thoáng và tươi trẻ.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #000000;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/63/16/25/16748aa80f7939f0add707dddc12907a.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"437\" /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u0